<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila okays Piltel long-term paper.</title>
<headline>Manila okays Piltel long-term paper.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) on Friday approved the application of cellular phone provider Pilipino Telephone Corp (Piltel) to issue 2.0 billion pesos worth of long-term commercial papers.</p>
<p>The company has proposed issuing seven-year papers but has not set a date.</p>
</text>
